  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together allspice, thyme, cayenne pepper, brown sugar, soy sauce, and 1 tablespoon vegetable oil.",
    "3. Add the chicken pieces to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "4. Thread the chicken onto the wooden skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "5. Brush the grill with oil to prevent sticking.",
    "6. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "7. Remove from heat and let rest for 2 minutes.",
    "8. Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
